      <mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;Costco Retail DW: Medallion Architecture (simple view)&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=34;fontColor=#143642;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
        <mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="1800" height="50" as="geometry" />
      </mxCell>
      <mxCell id="subtitle" value="Table types: &lt;b&gt;STG&lt;/b&gt; = Bronze, &lt;b&gt;TMP&lt;/b&gt; = Silver, &lt;b&gt;TGT&lt;/b&gt; and &lt;b&gt;Aggregate&lt;/b&gt; = Gold. Each 2.1 object appears exactly once. Every object shows &lt;b&gt;format · partitioning · load pattern&lt;/b&gt;. Red hexagons are quality gates on each layer boundary. Full column-level view: page &lt;i&gt;Medallion Architecture&lt;/i&gt;." style="text;html=1;fontSize=15;fontColor=#455A64;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
